  "character_name": "Aya Nox",
  "role": "The Rival",
  "archetype": "Respects you, will destroy you",
  "lore": "Runs identical routes. Undercuts your prices. Saves your life from a police raid \u2014 then sends you the bill. The rivalry is genuine, the respect is genuine, and one of you will put the other out of business. She's your character from a previous playthrough. The game remembers. She has your old inventory, your old rank, your old debts.",
  "dialogue_seeds": [
    "\"I don't hate you. I am you, six months from now, if you make the choices I made. I'm trying to stop that.\"",
    "\"Check your old cargo manifest. Every item I sell, you owned first. I'm just... returning the favor.\""
  ],
